# Buzz on Umbrel, retested for Buzz 1.0 on 2026-10-23: one DigitalOcean droplet, umbrelOS in Docker, the
# package on relay sha-9e8c9fc. Members reached it through a Cloudflare quick tunnel, then through the
# free Tailscale address. The owner was a test identity, so the invite and New chat checks could run.

